{% block body %}
  <main>

    <section class="portfolio-hero" aria-label="Senior freelance vs consulting firm">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="../" class="page-back" aria-label="Back to audit cases">← All audit cases</a>
        <p class="eyebrow">Senior freelance · Comparison</p>
        <h1 class="portfolio-hero__title">
          Why hire a senior freelance developer<br>
          for a technical audit instead<br>
          <em>of a consulting firm?</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="portfolio-hero__subtitle">
          A consulting firm bills coordination and methodology as much as actual expertise.
          A senior freelance works directly on your codebase, answers without filters,
          and delivers recommendations your team can act on,
          not an 80-page report for a steering committee.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-group">
          <a href="https://calendly.com/matthieu-viel-fr/30min"
             class="btn btn--primary btn--lg"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             aria-label="Book a discovery call (opens Calendly)">
            Discuss my project →
          </a>
          <a href="../faq/" class="btn btn--outline btn--lg">
            Frequently asked questions
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-header section-header--center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Concrete comparison</p>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="comparison-title">Freelance vs firm: what's different</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="problems__grid">
          <article class="problem-card fade-up">
            <div class="problem-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">🏢</div>
            <h3 class="problem-card__title">Consulting firm</h3>
            <p class="problem-card__text">
              You pay a project manager, one or more junior consultants,
              and sometimes a senior for final validation. Internal coordination is billed.
              The report is standardised and written to justify the engagement,
              not to be used directly. Average lead time: 4 to 8 weeks.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="problem-card fade-up">
            <div class="problem-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">👤</div>
            <h3 class="problem-card__title">Senior freelance</h3>
            <p class="problem-card__text">
              One person reads your code, asks the questions, and writes the recommendations.
              No intermediary, no coordination meetings.
              The report is calibrated for your team and your budget.
              Average lead time: 3 to 7 working days.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="proof__grid proof__grid--3col">
          <div class="stat-card fade-up">
            <p class="stat-card__number">3–5×</p>
            <p class="stat-card__label">cheaper than a firm for the same scope</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card fade-up">
            <p class="stat-card__number">5d</p>
            <p class="stat-card__label">average delivery vs 4–8 weeks for a firm</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card fade-up">
            <p class="stat-card__number">8+</p>
            <p class="stat-card__label">verified LinkedIn recommendations on real missions</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="layout-2col">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">What I bring</p>
            <h2 class="section-title section-title--2xl" id="profile-title">My auditor profile</h2>
            <p class="prose prose--mb">
              17 years of fullstack experience (Symfony, React, PHP, API Platform).
              I've worked on high-traffic SaaS platforms (Citeo, Sellermania),
              critical business applications, and greenfield projects.
            </p>
            <p class="prose prose--mb">
              I know what it means to maintain an ageing codebase over 7 years (Sellermania),
              bootstrap test coverage on a critical application (500+ Cypress scenarios at Citeo),
              and explain technical problems to a non-developer founder.
            </p>
            <p class="prose">
              Certified trainer (ECP Formation): I deliver recommendations in a way
              that your team can apply without depending on me.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Red flags</p>
            <h2 class="section-title section-title--2xl">What should concern you</h2>
            <ul class="plain-list">
              <li class="prose">
                ⚠️ Proposal that doesn't detail the expected deliverable
              </li>
              <li class="prose">
                ⚠️ "Full rewrite" as a systematic entry point
              </li>
              <li class="prose">
                ⚠️ Report unreadable without prior technical training
              </li>
              <li class="prose">
                ⚠️ No verifiable LinkedIn recommendations on similar missions
              </li>
              <li class="prose">
                ⚠️ Inability to explain the exact audit scope before signing
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Related pages">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Go further</p>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--2xl section-title--mb">Other audit cases</h2>
        <div class="related-audits">
          <a href="../application-vibe-coding-production/">AI-built application</a>
          <a href="../technical-debt-saas-application/">SaaS technical debt</a>
          <a href="../automated-tests-application/">Automated tests</a>
          <a href="../application-solo-founder-clients/">Solo app → first clients</a>
          <a href="../faq/">Technical audit FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--dark" aria-label="Contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="inner-cta">
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">First contact</p>
          <h2 class="inner-cta__title">Comparing your options?</h2>
          <p class="inner-cta__text">
            Tell me about your situation. I'll give you an honest assessment
            of whether a freelance or a firm is the better fit for your need.
          </p>
          <div class="inner-cta__actions">
            <a href="https://calendly.com/matthieu-viel-fr/30min"
               class="btn btn--outline-light btn--lg"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
               aria-label="Book a discovery call on Calendly (new tab)">
              Book a discovery call →
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:matthieu.viel.fr@gmail.com" class="btn btn--outline-light">
              matthieu.viel.fr@gmail.com
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
